            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/acea6be5b766bbb74a12fa5764b73f96.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=391 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PIONEER OF SIMULTANEOUS TURNS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both players plan their turns simultaneously, with every action resolving at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The result is a fast-paced contest of prediction, bluffing, and anticipation, without the long waits between turns found in traditional card games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pioneered by <i>Infinity Wars</i> in 2012, simultaneous turns remain a standout in game design, and more than a decade later, few games have rivalled its strategic depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/3c17df5592eaed2599eb8a88772f91b3.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/61b02910712c63138800c7f3b3c61322.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=391 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BEAUTIFULLY ANIMATED CARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every card in <i>Infinity Wars</i> is fully illustrated and animated, bringing each piece of art to life on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From characters to abilities, every card features unique animation that adds visual depth and energy to every match, redefining what a card game can be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/3c17df5592eaed2599eb8a88772f91b3.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/9ac1984db1618865c5093ba95f175881.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=391 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE COMMANDER-BASED DECK BUILDING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your strategy and lead your deck with three Commanders that define your strategy and unlock powerful faction bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine Commanders from different factions for flexible hybrid decks, or specialize in a single faction to access its strongest cards and synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With countless Commander combinations to explore, the possibilities are nearly endless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/3c17df5592eaed2599eb8a88772f91b3.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/751646f90bb2ca335b62242506986a03.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=391 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEATH TO PAY-TO-WIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Infinity Wars</i> believes in <strong>Death to Pay-to-Win</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build any deck, experiment with any strategy, and compete on a truly level playing field. Every player has access to the complete competitive card library, allowing skill, not spending, to determine the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory comes from deckbuilding, prediction, and gameplay mastery, not collection size.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/3c17df5592eaed2599eb8a88772f91b3.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/300ca0e988a4231cbda9b2ce19d404b5.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=391 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JUMP BACK INTO THE ACTION!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Returning to Infinity Wars?</strong><br>Your original collection is waiting, jump straight back into the fight with your original collection intact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Request an account transfer to restore your cards, cosmetics, and currency, and continue your journey where you left off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/3c17df5592eaed2599eb8a88772f91b3.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=165 /></span></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/acea6be5b766bbb74a12fa5764b73f96.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=391 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PIONEER OF SIMULTANEOUS TURNS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both players plan their turns simultaneously, with every action resolving at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The result is a fast-paced contest of prediction, bluffing, and anticipation, without the long waits between turns found in traditional card games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pioneered by <i>Infinity Wars</i> in 2012, simultaneous turns remain a standout in game design, and more than a decade later, few games have rivalled its strategic depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/3c17df5592eaed2599eb8a88772f91b3.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/61b02910712c63138800c7f3b3c61322.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=391 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BEAUTIFULLY ANIMATED CARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every card in <i>Infinity Wars</i> is fully illustrated and animated, bringing each piece of art to life on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From characters to abilities, every card features unique animation that adds visual depth and energy to every match, redefining what a card game can be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/3c17df5592eaed2599eb8a88772f91b3.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/9ac1984db1618865c5093ba95f175881.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=391 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE COMMANDER-BASED DECK BUILDING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your strategy and lead your deck with three Commanders that define your strategy and unlock powerful faction bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine Commanders from different factions for flexible hybrid decks, or specialize in a single faction to access its strongest cards and synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With countless Commander combinations to explore, the possibilities are nearly endless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/3c17df5592eaed2599eb8a88772f91b3.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/751646f90bb2ca335b62242506986a03.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=391 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEATH TO PAY-TO-WIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Infinity Wars</i> believes in <strong>Death to Pay-to-Win</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build any deck, experiment with any strategy, and compete on a truly level playing field. Every player has access to the complete competitive card library, allowing skill, not spending, to determine the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory comes from deckbuilding, prediction, and gameplay mastery, not collection size.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/3c17df5592eaed2599eb8a88772f91b3.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/300ca0e988a4231cbda9b2ce19d404b5.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=391 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JUMP BACK INTO THE ACTION!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Returning to Infinity Wars?</strong><br>Your original collection is waiting, jump straight back into the fight with your original collection intact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Request an account transfer to restore your cards, cosmetics, and currency, and continue your journey where you left off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/3c17df5592eaed2599eb8a88772f91b3.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=165 /></span></p>",
